   15	 * A player who cannot yet afford the plant does not leave a stalled planet
   16	 * mining into a deficit: he turns the worst mine down to what the power covers,
   17	 * and turns it back up once the plant lands. The mine is chosen from the host's
   18	 * own production numbers — the energy consumer that yields the least output per
